flowchart TD
    Start[User Run] --> Parse[AppConfig Parsing]
    Parse --> Factory{Create App}
    Factory -->|--cli| CLI[CliApp Instance]
    Factory -->|Default| GUI[GuiApp Instance]
    
    CLI --> Run[IApp::run()]
    GUI --> Run
    
    subgraph Core Logic
        L2[L2 Capture]
        UDP[UDP Socket]
        Filter[Packet Filter]
    end
    
    Run --> Mode{L2 Mode?}
    Mode -->|Yes| L2
    Mode -->|No| UDP
    
    L2 -->|Poll| Filter
    UDP -->|Recv| Filter
    
    Filter -->|Match| Log[Log Entry]
    Log --> Output{Output Strategy}
    Output -->|CLI| Console[Stdout Print]
    Output -->|GUI| UI[GUI WindowRender]
